Package: katu-default-settings
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Katu OS Team <katuos@gmail.com>
Depends: katu-branding, plasma-desktop, sddm
Priority: optional
Section: misc
Description: Katu OS default desktop configuration
 This package provides default KDE Plasma settings for Katu OS:
 panel layout, color schemes, application defaults,
 and system configuration tuned for the Katu OS experience.
